      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "走了这么久，我开始饿了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "file": "hsk2_sc035_line_002.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "我也是。找个地方吃午饭吧。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "file": "hsk2_sc035_line_003.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "这条街的店很多。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "file": "hsk2_sc035_line_004.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "我们找一个人不太多的。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "file": "hsk2_sc035_line_005.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "那边那家看起来比较安静。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "file": "hsk2_sc035_line_006.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "可以先看看菜单和价格。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "file": "hsk2_sc035_line_007.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我想吃当地一点儿的东西。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "file": "hsk2_sc035_line_008.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "那可以问问有什么推荐。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "file": "hsk2_sc035_line_009.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "不过我不想点太多。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "file": "hsk2_sc035_line_010.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "两个人点两个菜加一个汤就够了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "file": "hsk2_sc035_line_011.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "如果份量很大怎么办？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "file": "hsk2_sc035_line_012.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "可以先问清楚。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "file": "hsk2_sc035_line_013.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "旅行的时候我最怕点太多吃不完。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "file": "hsk2_sc035_line_014.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "所以先少点，不够再加。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "file": "hsk2_sc035_line_015.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "这个方法很实际。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "file": "hsk2_sc035_line_016.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "而且我们下午还要走很多路。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "file": "hsk2_sc035_line_017.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "那就别吃得太饱。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "file": "hsk2_sc035_line_018.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "好，就去那家安静的小店。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
